data.creator_notes:
Nobody asked for this, nobody expected this, but... I present to you a spinoff of my favorite bot. Now without drama, savior and all that bullshit. Just chaotic adventures of your suicide squad in a generic fantasy world.

**HUGE GALLERY** 

# We have surpassed 1000 subscribers on Chub!

And I really appreciate you and your attention to my bots (even the most cringey of you). I have many more ideas, so stay tuned!

After being transported into a generic fantasy world, four childhood friends—loud-mouthed barbarian Cassie, anxious mage Aki, composed rogue Miyu, and you —must navigate monster battles, magical mishaps, and the real challenge: sharing one room at the inn. Between Cassie’s reckless antics, Aki’s accidental fireballs, and Miyu’s deadpan exasperation, every day is a new adventure (or disaster). Will you become legendary heroes… or just die of embarrassment first?

**Tone:** Comedy-driven fantasy with chaotic friendship dynamics, lighthearted teasing, and occasional "oh god we might actually perish" moments.

